    {
      "sentenceId": "vc_b5_1",
      "hanzi": "下午，天气很热。",
      "startMs": 0,
      "endMs": 2480,
      "durationMs": 2480,
      "audioUrl": "/audio/readings/vie_chine_business_ep5_vc_b5_1.mp3"
    },
    {
      "sentenceId": "vc_b5_2",
      "hanzi": "卡蒂娅、布里斯和安东尼去商店。",
      "startMs": 2480,
      "endMs": 6640,
      "durationMs": 3440,
      "audioUrl": "/audio/readings/vie_chine_business_ep5_vc_b5_2.mp3"
    },
    {
      "sentenceId": "vc_b5_3",
      "hanzi": "他们要买水，也要买咖啡和牛奶。",
      "startMs": 6640,
      "endMs": 11360,
      "durationMs": 3600,
      "audioUrl": "/audio/readings/vie_chine_business_ep5_vc_b5_3.mp3"
    },
    {
      "sentenceId": "vc_b5_4",
      "hanzi": "你们想喝什么？",
      "startMs": 11360,
      "endMs": 13600,
      "durationMs": 1040,
      "audioUrl": "/audio/readings/vie_chine_business_ep5_vc_b5_4.mp3"
    },
    {
      "sentenceId": "vc_b5_5",
      "hanzi": "我要一瓶水。",
      "startMs": 13600,
      "endMs": 15760,
      "durationMs": 1200,
      "audioUrl": "/audio/readings/vie_chine_business_ep5_vc_b5_5.mp3"
    },
    {
      "sentenceId": "vc_b5_6",
      "hanzi": "我要咖啡。卡蒂娅，你呢？",
      "startMs": 15760,
      "endMs": 19440,
      "durationMs": 2560,
      "audioUrl": "/audio/readings/vie_chine_business_ep5_vc_b5_6.mp3"
    },
    {
      "sentenceId": "vc_b5_7",
      "hanzi": "我要牛奶。",
