      "durationMs": 2160,
      "audioUrl": "/audio/readings/vie_chine_business_ep5_vc_b5_13.mp3"
    },
    {
      "sentenceId": "vc_b5_14",
      "hanzi": "他们买了一瓶水，两瓶咖啡，一瓶牛奶。",
